patients enrolled in the randomized placebo-controlled trial of
ORG 10172 (danaparoid) in acute stroke treatment (TOAST).
SIE was defined as deterioration in NIH Stroke Scale score
between the initial assessment and the administration of dana-
paroid. We analyzed the influence of danaparoid on 3 month
favourable outcome defined as a Glasgow Outcome Score (GOS)
of I or II and modified Barthel Index (BI) of 12 or greater. Logis-
