non-SIE. Both groups were similar in baseline characteristics
except a higher baseline NIHSS score in the SIE group. Among
SIE patients, a favourable outcome was achieved in 56/80 (70%)
of the danaparoid-treated group and 53/79 (67%) in the placebo
group (67%) (chi-square p=0.69). Treatment group allocation did
not influence outcome after adjusting for baseline NIHSS score.
