patients admitted to the emergency department of the Lille Univer-
sity hospital (11/2004 – 08/2007) for a supratentorial ICH. The ori-
gin of the ICH was defined on the 1st CT -scan performed at admis-
sion. We studied predictive factors of in-hospital death in lobar and
in deep ICH separately.
