129 (42%) lobar. The in-hospital mortality rate was 37% in lobar
and 41% in deep ICH (p=0.234). In lobar ICH, multivariate analy-
ses showed that the only predictive factor of death was the volume
(OR 1.05 per 1 ml increase; 95 CI 1.04–1.08). In deep ICH, vol-
