During the last decade IT+AHSCT has been used with increasing
frequency as a therapeutic option for MS patients. The goal of our
research was to study long-term treatment outcomes in MS patients
after IT+AHSCT. 56 patients with different types of MS (secondary
progressive SP – 27, primary progressive PP – 10, progressive-
relapsing PR – 1, relapsing-remitting RR – 18) were included in this
